---
// src/components/WhyStegg.astro
---

<section id="why-stegg" class="reveal w-full py-[120px] border-t border-[#222222] scroll-mt-20" style="background-color: #0F1117;">
    <div class="max-w-[1100px] mx-auto px-6">

        <div class="mb-16">
            <p class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.15em] text-[#444444] uppercase mb-4">Why Stegg</p>
            <h2 class="text-[clamp(36px,4vw,56px)] font-[800] text-[#FAFAFA] tracking-tight leading-[1.05] mb-6">Built <span class="gradient-word">differently</span>.</h2>
            <p class="text-[17px] text-[#888888] max-w-xl leading-[1.7]">
                We don't use templates or heavy page builders. Every Stegg site is engineered from the ground up for raw performance, security, and ROI.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-5">

            <div class="feature-card group p-8 rounded-2xl bg-[#111111] border border-[#222222]">
                <div class="icon-wrapper w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#1A1A1A] border border-[#2A2A2A] flex items-center justify-center mb-7">
                    <i data-lucide="zap" class="w-5 h-5 text-[#2563EB]"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-[700] text-[#FAFAFA] mb-3 tracking-tight">Sub-Second Speed</h3>
                <p class="text-[17px] text-[#888888] leading-[1.7]">
                    Your customers won't wait. We hand-code our sites to load instantly, preventing ad budget waste from high mobile bounce rates.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card group p-8 rounded-2xl bg-[#111111] border border-[#222222]">
                <div class="icon-wrapper w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#1A1A1A] border border-[#2A2A2A] flex items-center justify-center mb-7">
                    <i data-lucide="feather" class="w-5 h-5 text-[#2563EB]"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-[700] text-[#FAFAFA] mb-3 tracking-tight">Zero Bloatware</h3>
                <p class="text-[17px] text-[#888888] leading-[1.7]">
                    No Wix. No WordPress. No heavy plugins. We strip away the unnecessary code that drags down your search rankings.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card group p-8 rounded-2xl bg-[#111111] border border-[#222222]">
                <div class="icon-wrapper w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#1A1A1A] border border-[#2A2A2A] flex items-center justify-center mb-7">
                    <i data-lucide="shield-check" class="w-5 h-5 text-[#2563EB]"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-[700] text-[#FAFAFA] mb-3 tracking-tight">Enterprise Security</h3>
                <p class="text-[17px] text-[#888888] leading-[1.7]">
                    Say goodbye to cheap, vulnerable shared hosting. We deploy your site on world-class infrastructure so you never have to worry about hacks or downtime.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card group p-8 rounded-2xl bg-[#111111] border border-[#222222] relative overflow-hidden">
                <div class="absolute -bottom-12 -right-12 w-40 h-40 rounded-full pointer-events-none group-hover:opacity-100 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500" style="background: rgba(37,99,235,0.08); filter: blur(40px);"></div>
                <div class="icon-wrapper w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#1A1A1A] border border-[#2A2A2A] flex items-center justify-center mb-7 relative z-10">
                    <i data-lucide="target" class="w-5 h-5 text-[#2563EB]"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-[700] text-[#FAFAFA] mb-3 tracking-tight relative z-10">pSEO Architecture</h3>
                <p class="text-[17px] text-[#888888] leading-[1.7] relative z-10">
                    Built-in Programmatic SEO logic. We structure your site to automatically capture local search traffic without expensive monthly retainers.
                </p>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .feature-card {
        box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.06), 0 0 0 1px #1E1E1E;
        transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1),
                    border-color 0.2s ease,
                    box-shadow 0.3s ease,
                    background-color 0.2s ease;
    }
    .feature-card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-4px);
        border-color: #333333;
        background-color: #1A1A1A;
        box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.08),
                    0 0 0 1px rgba(37,99,235,0.2),
                    0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    }

    .gradient-word {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #60a5fa, #a78bfa);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        background-clip: text;
    }

    .feature-card:hover .icon-wrapper {
        transform: rotate(-5deg);
        transition: transform 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
    }
</style>
